  "provenance": "Original WCSpedia vector artwork created in this repository. No third-party artwork, external fonts, embedded raster images or external requests. Twenty original knowledge and work motifs, each drawn in five distinct spatial compositions. Citi blue, navy and red accent palette matches the application.",
